{
  "_comment": [
    "Copied verbatim from aurora-lint data/benchmark_repos.json at the commit",
    "named in `source`; regenerate with `tcb pins refresh-corpus`, never hand-edit",
    "the `repos` block. Each `version` is the commit the oracle labels are keyed",
    "on. Juliet is pinned here too: every tool runs the same suite commit."
  ],
